# LF normalization (issue #271)
# Digest pins (references/_INDEX.yaml) are sha256 of LF bytes. Force LF on
# every platform so pins match regardless of core.autocrlf / core.eol — a
# CRLF checkout previously produced digest drift and failed
# tests/test_replay_gate.py (#355: the memory/ corpus manifest pins were
# removed with the memory/ subsystem).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary guard: repo currently has no binaries, but never EOL-convert
# or trailing-newline these classes if they are ever added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.pyc binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
